Sam Rufener, vice president of the NREA said this is probably the first time in about 20 years the parade falls outside of the last day of school. "Seniors' last day is the 15th. The parade is two weeks later. Underclassmen finish up on the Friday before Memorial Day, May 26. So that's the unique situation. Anyone who would show up for the parade would be voluntary."
